```{=html}
<ul class="package-cards">
<% for (const item of items) { %>
<li class="package-card">
<img class="hex" src="<%- item.hex %>" alt="" width="96" height="111" loading="lazy">
<span class="body">
<a class="stretched" href="<%- item.path %>"><%= item.title %></a>
<% if (item.description) { %><span class="desc"><%= item.description %></span><% } %>
</span>
</li>
<% } %>
</ul>
```
